---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<MainLayout
title="AI Comparisons | CreatorStack"
description="Compare the best AI tools side by side."
canonical="https://creatorstack2-0.pages.dev/comparisons"
>

<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-700 py-24 text-white">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 text-center">

<span class="rounded-full bg-white/20 px-5 py-2 font-bold">

⚖️ AI Comparisons

</span>

<h1 class="mt-8 text-6xl font-extrabold">

Compare AI Tools

</h1>

<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl text-xl leading-9 text-blue-100">

We compare the most popular AI tools side by side so you can choose the right one.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">

<div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">

<a
href="/comparisons/canva-ai-vs-adobe-express"
class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10 shadow-lg transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl"
>

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">

Canva AI vs Adobe Express

</h2>

<p class="mt-6 text-gray-600">

Which AI design platform is better?

</p>

<span class="mt-8 inline-block font-bold text-blue-600">

Read Comparison →

</span>

</a>

<div class="rounded-3xl border border-dashed bg-gray-50 p-10">

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">

Coming Soon

</h2>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">

<li>VEED vs CapCut</li>

<li>ChatGPT vs Claude</li>

<li>ChatGPT vs Gemini</li>

<li>Canva AI vs Microsoft Designer</li>

<li>ElevenLabs vs Murf</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<Footer />

</MainLayout>